From 276a194b47fe9d9e7dfe314b869792ab56b1002c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kernel86-64 <87580651+kernel86-64@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:08:02 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 13/59] kbuild: add the empty Kconfig.ext placeholder

The ACK Kconfig sources Kconfig.ext at the top level. The standalone joan build does not define KCONFIG_EXT_PREFIX, so provide the same empty placeholder the 6.18 tree carries.
---
 Kconfig.ext | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Kconfig.ext

diff --git a/Kconfig.ext b/Kconfig.ext
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..48d805f0b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Kconfig.ext
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+# This file is intentionally empty. It's used as a placeholder for when
+# KCONFIG_EXT_PREFIX isn't defined.
